From 1601bfe5294d95e21c42361a7d1692550beb30b6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kopebax <kopebax@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 10:59:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] mm, shmem: backport memfd_create() and file sealing

Backport of the v3.17 series:
  4bb5f5d9395b mm: allow drivers to prevent new writable mappings
  40e041a2c858 shm: add sealing API
  9183df25fe7b shm: add memfd_create() syscall
  05f65b5c7090 shm: wait for pins to be released when sealing

Adapted to 3.10 (mmap_region error paths, shmem_setattr, local
cond_resched_rcu()). memfd_create is syscall 279 (arm64) and 385
(compat). Current glib/tracker, pulseaudio and other userspace in
Sailfish OS 5 depend on it.
